{"n": 611, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "611.webp", "text": "3231090 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nCOMPLETE STEERING\nCOLUMN (AIRBAG)\n\nCaution!\n\nObserve safety regulations!\n\nRemove instrument panel trim at bottom left\n— 51 45 180.\n\nRemove steering wheel — 32 33 000.\n\nRemove flasher relay.\n\nPull off plug on horn contact.\n\nRemove switch.\n\nInstallation:\n\nMount both ground wires (1).\n\nWith cruise control switch screw (2) = M5 x 15.\nTabs of switch must engage in bore (3).\n\nTake off collar (1),\nInstallation:\nRecess of collar (1) locks circlip {2).\n\nPress down locking hooks and take off\nignition switch.\n\nUnscrew bolt.\n\nRemove clainping bolt and pull joint off of\nsteering spindle.\n\nInstallation:\n\nClamping bolt must be in locking groove of\nsteering spindle.\n\nReplace salftocking nut.\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nRemove both shear-off screws with a chisel or\nsimilar tool.\nTake off steering column.\n\nInstallation:\nUse spacer.\nPull up steering column completely.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["3231090", 0.2675, 0.0637, 0.3161, 0.0743], ["REMOVING", 0.3303, 0.0637, 0.3896, 0.0756], ["AND", 0.3941, 0.0643, 0.4174, 0.0756], ["INSTALLING", 0.4215, 0.0643, 0.4883, 0.0756], ["COMPLETE", 0.3293, 0.0796, 0.387, 0.0915], ["STEERING", 0.3911, 0.0802, 0.4468, 0.0915], ["COLUMN", 0.3293, 0.0962, 0.3759, 0.1074], ["(AIRBAG)", 0.381, 0.0962, 0.4306, 0.1088], ["Caution!", 0.2675, 0.1286, 0.309, 0.1393], ["Observe", 0.2675, 0.1446, 0.305, 0.1558], ["safety", 0.3085, 0.1446, 0.3369, 0.1578], ["regulations!", 0.3404, 0.1452, 0.3951, 0.1578], ["Remove", 0.268, 0.1618, 0.306, 0.1724], ["instrument", 0.31, 0.1611, 0.3617, 0.1718], ["panel", 0.3647, 0.1618, 0.3896, 0.1737], ["trim", 0.3941, 0.1618, 0.4134, 0.1718], ["at", 0.4169, 0.1631, 0.4255, 0.1718], ["bottom", 0.4296, 0.1618, 0.464, 0.1724], ["left", 0.4686, 0.1618, 0.4843, 0.1724], ["—", 0.2675, 0.183, 0.2741, 0.1844], ["51", 0.2786, 0.1771, 0.2888, 0.1883], ["45", 0.2938, 0.1777, 0.306, 0.1883], ["180